The '''Weird Sailor''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Kuudra's Hollow}}. 

== Purpose ==
The '''Weird Sailor''' appears in {{Zone|Kuudra's Hollow}} after defeating [[Kuudra]] and within {{Green|30}} minutes of donating {{C|1m}} to the {{NPCSprite|Kuudra Believer}}.

The player can obtain the [[Wet Napkin]] by fishing next to them with a Lava [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]] and [[Ice Bait]] while wearing an [[Elegant Tuxedo]] and a [[Bonzo's Mask]] with the {{Ench|Respiration I}} [[Enchantment]].

