== Trivia ==
*The '''Weird Sailor''' sits in a [[Minecart]] floating on [[Lava]].
*Assuming the 'big fish' mentioned in the '''Weird Sailor's''' dialogue is [[Kuudra]]; it is the second [[NPC]] that references trying to fish up [[Kuudra]], the first being [[Elle]].
*Any reference to [[Water]] in the '''Weird Sailor'''<nowiki/>s dialogue is actually [[Lava]].
*The '15 seconds' refers to the time extension of {{Ench|Respiration I}}.
*The 'circus' mentioned in the '''Weird Sailor'''<nowiki/>'s dialogue could be related to {{MobSprite|Bonzo}}'s arena.
**This is enforced by the fact that a [[Bonzo's Mask]] is required to trigger a line of dialogue.
*It is one of three [[NPC]]s that speak in internet slang, the others being {{NPCSprite|Fetchur}} and {{NPCSprite|Fossil Muncher}}.<!--
*{{RN|a|JacobRuby}} teased the existence of the '''Weird Sailor''' through several messages in the [https://discord.gg/Uq9XHD5V Official Hunters Discord™] such as "The tides are not high on a particular man's shore...".[https://discord.com/channels/996884296860172469/997596614241824960/1008124102881583194]-->
*The location of the '''Weird Sailor''' is blocked behind the barriers before and during the fight of Kuudra.

